        "\n",
        "## 9. RAG 链设计模式总结\n",
        "\n",
        "### 在本课中学习了三种核心 RAG 设计模式：\n",
        "\n",
        "| 模式 | LCEL 表达式 | 适用场景 |\n",
        "|------|-------------|----------|\n",
        "| **检索链** | `retriever \\| format_docs` | 仅需检索文档 |\n",
        "| **RAG 链** | `{\"context\": r \\| f, \"q\": R} \\| p \\| m \\| o` | 标准问答 |\n",
        "| **对话式 RAG** | RAG 链 + `MessagesPlaceholder` + 问题重写 | 多轮对话 |\n",
        "\n",
        "### 与第03阶段自定义实现的关键对比\n",
        "\n",
        "| 维度 | 自定义实现 | LCEL 实现 |\n",
        "|------|-----------|----------|\n",
        "| 代码行数 | ~56 行 | ~15 行（减少 73%）|\n",
        "| 数据流可见性 | 需跟踪方法调用 | 声明式可视化 |\n",
        "| 异步支持 | 需手动实现 | 内置 `.ainvoke()` |\n",
        "| 流式支持 | 需手动实现 | 内置 `.stream()` |\n",
        "| 并行化 | 需手动管理 | 自动（RunnableParallel）|\n",
        "| 可观测性 | 需手动集成 | 自动（LangSmith）|\n",
        "| 可测试性 | 需完整类 | 组件级别测试 |\n",
        "\n",
        "### 核心模式速查\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "# 标准 RAG 链\n",
        "rag_chain = (\n",
        "    {\"context\": retriever | format_docs, \"question\": RunnablePassthrough()}\n",
        "    | prompt | model | StrOutputParser()\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 对话式 RAG 链\n",
        "conv_rag_chain = (\n",
        "    RunnablePassthrough.assign(\n",
        "        context=contextualize_q | retriever | format_docs\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    | prompt_with_history | model | StrOutputParser()\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 带引用的 RAG 链\n",
        "cited_rag_chain = (\n",
        "    RunnablePassthrough.assign(\n",
        "        context=retriever | format_docs,\n",
        "        sources=retriever,\n",
        "        answer=prompt | model | parser,\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    | add_citations\n",
        ")\n",
        "```"
